# select-reasoning-strategy ({{ abbreviation }})

## Purpose

Reads `plugins/{{ id }}/omode.yaml`, matches the incoming seed intent to a
trigger (first semantic match wins), verifies the selected reasoning strategy
id exists in `.agents/skills/reasoning/`, and returns the strategy binding
for `govern-{{ domain }}-intent` to use.

## When to Use

- Immediately before `govern-{{ domain }}-intent` runs, within an open PMCRO cycle.

## When Not to Use

- Outside an open cycle (L-PLUGIN-ISOLATION).
- To select strategies for other Chiefs — each Chief has its own omode map.

## Input

```json
{ "seed": "<raw or governed seed intent text>" }
```

## Output

```json
{
  "selected_strategy": "<id from .agents/skills/reasoning/>",
  "frame_shape": "{{ intent_frame_kind }}",
  "matched_trigger": "<trigger string or 'default'>",
  "catalog_path": ".agents/skills/reasoning/<id>/"
}
```

## Matching logic

1. Read all `modes[]` from `plugins/{{ id }}/omode.yaml` top-to-bottom.
2. For each mode, check if the seed semantically matches `trigger` (substring
   or close paraphrase). First match wins.
3. If no trigger matches, use `default_reasoning_strategy`.
4. Verify the selected strategy id has a folder in `.agents/skills/reasoning/`.
   If missing, return an error — do not invent a fallback.

## OMode triggers for {{ display_name }}

{% for mode in modes %}
| `{{ mode.trigger }}` | `{{ mode.reasoning_strategy }}` |
{% endfor %}
| _(default)_ | `{{ default_reasoning_strategy }}` |

## Constraints

- Never invent a reasoning strategy id not present in `.agents/skills/reasoning/`.
- Must operate inside an open cycle (L-PLUGIN-ISOLATION).
- Follow L-EVIDENCE, L-OUTPUT-CONTRACT.

